### Added

- Add inline `[n]` citation badges anchored in the sanitized Markdown assistant answer, with a hover/focus tooltip and unanchored citations kept in the sources list. ([#245](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/245))
- Add a primary action button in the ticket header driven by `SuggestedNextSteps`, now an `IReadOnlyList<SuggestedStep>` tagged with the action each step routes to. ([#237](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/237))
- Add a keyboard-operable command palette opened with `Ctrl/Cmd+K` on every page, offering navigation entries from `NavRegistry` and debounced, cancellable ticket search. ([#236](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/236))
