  ! #238: "and header and row cells stay aligned in both light and dark themes." - The fact only says the Category column got a 140px width and alignment stayed intact; verification was at 1600px, and the facts do not mention checking both themes beyond the acceptance criterion text.
  ! #240: "On older Chrome versions, a long ticket title on the board could stretch its card without limit." - Supported in substance, but the claim that titles are now cut to two lines was not observable as fixed on older Chrome; the facts say the bug did not reproduce on Chrome 149 and the fix is inert there.
